I am in the fitting room.
Now I take a yellow skirt.
It is a cotton garment.
Its colour is bright.
I wear that skirt.
I look in the mirror.
This skirt is not good.
It is very small.
It is tight.
It is not comfortable in the heat of Mumbai.
I look at its price tag.
The skirt's price is high.
It is expensive.
Therefore, I do not want this small garment.
I take off that skirt.
I put it aside.
I do not buy this.
